# testdata

Each locked rule has a fixture. Live eFleets/OneStep/Supabase are never required.

| Rule | Where |
|---|---|
| Last Reading = fill odo + drive-stop miles | `internal/oil` TestEvaluateGoldenFillPlusDriveStop + `fixtures/lastreading_golden.json` |
| Backward odo rejected | `internal/oil` TestBackwardOdoRejected |
| Unusual Y → HOLD, no write | `internal/oil` TestUnusualYHoldNoWrite |
| Shop RO typically beats fuel; shop spike abandoned (148k…170k…149k) | `internal/oil` TestShopROTypicallyBeatsFuel, TestShopSpikeAbandonedByLaterFills, TestFuelSpikeAbandoned |
| Lower Last Reading refused; `--override-lower` writes | `internal/oil` TestLowerReadingRefusedAndOverride |
| factory_id join, not display_name | `internal/oil` TestJoinIsFactoryIDNotDisplayName + `internal/onestep` |
| Multi-device fight → HOLD | `internal/oil` TestMultiDeviceFight |
| Digit-swap only when flagged and in band | `internal/oil` TestDigitSwapOnlyWhenFlaggedAndInBand |
| VA15/VA19 card mix → HOLD | `internal/oil` TestCardMixVA15VA19 + `enterprise/details_cardmix.csv` |
| Opaque PDI id, no state prefix | `internal/enterprise` TestOpaquePDIID |
| Exporter never writes remaining/due | `internal/export` TestNeverWritesRemainingDue |
| Logistics personnel names do not link devices | `internal/oil` TestLogisticsPersonnelDoesNotLinkDevice |
| Station ladder 3/5/10 exclusive pumps; driver-kept / SPLIT / office / TRACKER | `internal/cards` TestStationLadder* |
| Card history one-path CLI + backprop eras | `internal/app` TestCardsHistory* + `internal/cards` TestBackprop* |
| Devices CSV display_name is a label only | `internal/onestep` TestWriteDevicesCSVDisplayNameIsLabelOnly |
| Device Information JSON file-drop VIN pair (imei=factory_id; params.vin ignored) | `testdata/onestep/device_information.json` + `internal/onestep` TestParseDevicesDeviceInformation* + `internal/app` TestApplyDeviceInformation* |
| Same-second different odo → SAME_SECOND_FILL | `internal/oil` TestSameSecondDifferentOdo |
| Dead factory_id not summed | `internal/oil` TestDeadFactoryIDNotSummed |
| Header trim (`Cust Name `) not column I/J | `enterprise/details.csv` |
| Real DETAILS/Maintenance/FleetSummary header sets | `testdata/enterprise/*.csv` |
| SYNTHETIC wrong-card / station-day trace (not live eFleets) | `enterprise/details_wrongcard.csv` + `fleetsummary_wrongcard.csv` |
